## 학습 진행 현황

```dataview
TABLE WITHOUT ID
  file.link AS "노트",
  part AS "Part",
  week AS "주차",
  status AS "상태",
  difficulty AS "난이도"
FROM "01-Concepts/Data-Layer"
SORT part ASC, week ASC
```

### 진행률 요약

```dataview
TABLE WITHOUT ID
  part AS "Part",
  length(rows) AS "총 노트",
  length(filter(rows, (r) => r.status = "done")) AS "완료",
  round(length(filter(rows, (r) => r.status = "done")) / length(rows) * 100) + "%" AS "진행률"
FROM "01-Concepts/Data-Layer"
GROUP BY part
SORT part ASC
```

